===Take a walk around and wait for the escorting judge's arrival{{subst:void|<!--202210401-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

:{{DIcon|Изучение}} Investigate
:You notice the Scalegorge Waterscape's Shackling Prison was built at the bottom of the ancient sea, as a column structure that extends endlessly into the depths. Spiritfarers monitor and manage real-time information of prison cells and prisoners on this screen.

;(Talk to Dan Heng)
:'''Dan Heng:''' This place... it's still as cold as it used to be.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Are you okay, Dan Heng?
::'''Dan Heng:''' Sorry, I was just reminiscing about some unpleasant memories.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Once we're done with the testimony, we'll leave immediately.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Even if you can't escape your past, we're always here for you.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Thank you, (Trailblazer). It's all my fault that you were involved in the Xianzhou's problems. You shouldn't have to see the inside of The Shackling Prison... I'm so sorry.
::'''Dan Heng:''' I wish I could show you the real sights of the Luofu.
::Dan Heng gently pats your hand.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Why can't they record our testimony outside The Shackling Prison?
::'''Dan Heng:''' The Six Charioteers might have more power over the rest of this Xianzhou ship, but here, in The Shackling Prison, it's the judges of the Ten-Lords Commission who call the shots.
::'''Dan Heng:''' The judges will use a complicated interrogation device called the Karmic Mirror. It accurately tracks every physiological change during questioning and records it.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Therefore, the judgment made here will be sufficient to convince the other administrators of the Xianzhou... At least they won't attempt to challenge the conclusions. Perhaps that's why Feixiao insisted that we come here.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Since the judge isn't here yet, I'll just wander around a bit.
::'''Dan Heng:''' Okay, but watch your step. This place is not like the others.

