===Wait for the escorting judge's arrival{{subst:void|<!--202210403-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:{{tx}}
:'''Hanya:''' Welcome, dear guests from the Express. Judge Hanya of the Interrogation Division, we've met before.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Miss Hanya?
::'''Hanya:''' Glad to meet you again, (Trailblazer).
::It's you!?
::'''Hanya:''' As one of the judges from the Interrogation Division, I'll be recording your testimony today.
::Are you and your sister the only judges here?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's you!?
::'''Hanya:''' As one of the judges from the Interrogation Division, I'll be recording your testimony today.
::Are you and your sister the only judges here?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you and your sister the only judges here?
:'''Hanya:''' Hmm? You don't want to see me, (Trailblazer)? Well, in that case, I can call in the judge who's an expert in acupuncture, or the one who's handy with axes and saws, or the one who knows all about whips and ropes... We've got plenty of options here, and we'll find one that suits your taste.
:'''Hanya:''' Just kidding. We judges work in shifts, and it just happens to be my shift, (Trailblazer). Maybe we're destined to cross paths.
:'''Hanya:''' Please allow me to express my gratitude to you again for {{Rubi|subduing the demons in the Fyxestroll Garden|Subduing Heliobi}}.
:'''Dan Heng:''' Looks like while March 7th and I were clueless, you already made many friends on the Xianzhou Luofu.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It was all a lucky coincidence.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Pom-Pom takes care of us at home, and friends take care of us on the road. That's just how it goes.
:'''Hanya:''' Even though (Trailblazer) and I have met before, we can't show any favoritism under the Ten Lords. So, please do as I command as we head to Scrivener Hall and beyond. Don't do anything without my permission.
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

